        "title": "Alung rui muthui lak ge aram",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Alungrui mu thuilak ge aram,",
            "Ruanry ta pat lou lana,",
            "Neilamei munpuang kaganv nituai the,",
            "Lily puang tuaikum tuai e.",
            "",
            "Agu alang apin kaan lana",
            "Zipkei zipman na tat re",
            "Nngow thing bang rim khou achun su",
            "Heikandi hei mik dui kaiphun di the.",
            "Rian ramei nah akhang .",
            "",
            "2. Luang but gaikhou kuding najaoki",
            "Alung ta tikabiu lou,",
            "Nrin keimei rui phanghou tang thuimak",
            "Mikduirui changriu khuan ne.",
            "",
            "3. Mageiluang kaomei aram luang e,",
            "Tabui nung guang tang nicho,",
            "Nruai nakum sam nu tuang khuan nithei,",
            "Ai ningmei ram sam nu e.",
            "",
            "4. Kagan gaimei guai tat rikan the,",
            "Munpuang gaimei guai teini",
            "Nzianmei nun ram ta ningtou puki,",
            "Kagan ruiphung du kan the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
